    "body": "Codex stopped before a claim. No branch or code change exists.\n\nUpstream/main 69c9fd7af includes PR #2904, merge bac4a96c7, and PR #2934, merge 543204319.\nThe solidcore importer replaces the old truck path. The old step_nearest.rs file is absent.\n\nThe existing app tests in crates/app/tests/import_step_twisted_flank.rs are:\n- the_twisted_flank_imports_at_full_fidelity_and_its_volume\n- the_twisted_flank_with_a_vertex_off_its_curves_is_refused_by_name\n\nThe tests assert full fidelity, volume 8000 mm3 within tolerance, and a named refusal for the invalid fixture.\nThis check inspected code only. It did not run the tests or measure import time.\n\nThe latest status says that the reporter's file is unavailable. The existing synthetic fixtures already have regression tests.\nI cannot reproduce the remaining report without the original file or a new failing fixture. The issue stays open.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
