    "updated_at": "2026-11-24T06:37:28Z",
    "body": "Looks already fixed on upstream/main f519445d4. The synthetic case does not reproduce without a change.\n\n- Command: `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test import_step_twisted_flank` on a detached worktree at upstream/main f519445d4.\n- Result: 2 passed, 0 failed.\n  - `the_twisted_flank_imports_at_full_fidelity_and_its_volume` passes. The legal twisted degree-3 B-spline fixture `testdata/models/twisted_flank.step` imports.\n  - `the_twisted_flank_with_a_vertex_off_its_curves_is_refused_by_name` passes. The bad fixture `twisted_flank_off.step` still gets a named refusal.\n- The likely fix is PR #2904 (the solidcore STEP import, merge bac4a96c7). The old `step_nearest.rs` is absent.\n- The speed item depended on #2844. #2844 is now closed.\n\nCodex did not claim this issue and made no branch. The only open part is the reporter's private file. That file is not available. Suggest closing; the maintainer decides.\n",
